/ ============================================================================
/ FLEXI ADMIN EXAMPLE: Show Page Template
/ ============================================================================
/ The show page uses FlexiAdmin::Components::Resource::ViewComponent as wrapper.
/ It provides:
/   - Title (from resource.title)
/   - Edit/Delete buttons (with Stimulus controllers)
/   - Form slot (edit form, rendered in disabled mode by default)
/   - Actions slot (custom action buttons)
/   - Content area (everything after the slots — nested resources go here)
/
/ The edit button triggers form#enable Stimulus action to toggle edit mode.
/ ============================================================================

= render FlexiAdmin::Components::Resource::ViewComponent.new(context,
    delete_confirm_message: 'Are you sure? This action cannot be undone.') do |c|

  / --- Edit form slot ---
  / Rendered in read-only (disabled) mode by default.
  / The edit button toggles it to editable via Stimulus.
  - c.with_form do
    = render Admin::User::Show::EditFormComponent.new(resource, disabled: disabled)

  / --- Custom actions slot (optional) ---
  / Add action buttons that appear next to the edit/delete buttons.
  - c.with_actions do
    = render FlexiAdmin::Components::Actions::SelectComponent.new(scope: 'users') do |select|
      - select.with_action do
        = action Admin::User::BulkAction::ResetModalComponent, selection_dependent: false

  / --- Nested resources ---
  / Everything after the slots is rendered below the form.
  / Use ResourcesComponent with parent: to enable nested CRUD.
  .d-flex.flex-column.gap-4

    / Nested comments list with parent context
    div
      h2 Comments
      = render Admin::Comment::ResourcesComponent.new(comments,
                                                       context_params:,
                                                       parent: resource)
